* PDN impedance at the worst-case 3V3M pin, from extracted layout.
* Element values: R from the solved copper network, L from the real
* via geometry and routed path, C from the placed part.
* h = outer-layer to first-plane dielectric height in mm (swept),
* because the board declares no stackup.
.param h=0.12
Itest 0 vdd AC 1
Rsrc vdd nsrc 0.172476
Lsrc nsrc 0 {2.2851e-07*h}
* C502 0603 2200 nF, 103.2 mm from the pin
R0 vdd a0 0.267813
L0 a0 b0 {3.34849e-07*h+5.5e-10}
C0 b0 0 2.2e-06
Rp0 b0 0 1G
* C211 0402 2200 nF, 116.0 mm from the pin
R1 vdd a1 0.303842
L1 a1 b1 {3.72697e-07*h+4e-10}
C1 b1 0 2.2e-06
Rp1 b1 0 1G
* C221 0603 1000 nF, 122.1 mm from the pin
R2 vdd a2 0.3135
L2 a2 b2 {3.90879e-07*h+5.5e-10}
C2 b2 0 1e-06
Rp2 b2 0 1G
* C209 0402 100 nF, 108.1 mm from the pin
R3 vdd a3 0.28685
L3 a3 b3 {3.45462e-07*h+4e-10}
C3 b3 0 1e-07
Rp3 b3 0 1G
* C667 0402 100 nF, 49.4 mm from the pin
R4 vdd a4 0.14836
L4 a4 b4 {1.62127e-07*h+4e-10}
C4 b4 0 1e-07
Rp4 b4 0 1G
* C515 0402 100 nF, 16.4 mm from the pin
R5 vdd a5 0.0676338
L5 a5 b5 {6.16691e-08*h+4e-10}
C5 b5 0 1e-07
Rp5 b5 0 1G
* C203 0402 100 nF, 109.0 mm from the pin
R6 vdd a6 0.288785
L6 a6 b6 {3.48542e-07*h+4e-10}
C6 b6 0 1e-07
Rp6 b6 0 1G
* C205 0402 100 nF, 66.1 mm from the pin
R7 vdd a7 0.186622
L7 a7 b7 {2.14567e-07*h+4e-10}
C7 b7 0 1e-07
Rp7 b7 0 1G
* C206 0402 100 nF, 104.8 mm from the pin
R8 vdd a8 0.278761
L8 a8 b8 {3.36325e-07*h+4e-10}
C8 b8 0 1e-07
Rp8 b8 0 1G
* C204 0402 100 nF, 68.6 mm from the pin
R9 vdd a9 0.192646
L9 a9 b9 {2.21685e-07*h+4e-10}
C9 b9 0 1e-07
Rp9 b9 0 1G
* C628 0402 100 nF, 60.5 mm from the pin
R10 vdd a10 0.172843
L10 a10 b10 {1.98274e-07*h+4e-10}
C10 b10 0 1e-07
Rp10 b10 0 1G
* C208 0402 100 nF, 112.9 mm from the pin
R11 vdd a11 0.297229
L11 a11 b11 {3.60633e-07*h+4e-10}
C11 b11 0 1e-07
Rp11 b11 0 1G
* C207 0402 100 nF, 117.9 mm from the pin
R12 vdd a12 0.309288
L12 a12 b12 {3.76104e-07*h+4e-10}
C12 b12 0 1e-07
Rp12 b12 0 1G
* C210 0402 100 nF, 103.6 mm from the pin
R13 vdd a13 0.275162
L13 a13 b13 {3.32039e-07*h+4e-10}
C13 b13 0 1e-07
